  "description": "Accounts, roles, settings and shared scouting data. Cookie session auth; send X-CSRF-Token (= cs_csrf cookie) on mutating requests. Roles: viewer < scout < strategist < admin. Site JSON (/api/*) and media (/media/*) are served by nginx, gated by GET /app/v1/auth/check.",
